'''Foreman Hetfield''' is a [[Dwarf|dwarf]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found under the [[Snowhill]] [[Playground|playground]]. Players can interact with him through left-click or the "x" key and then prompted to either accept or deny opening the [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]], he introduces has a specific filter default on housing items that are typically used for building playgrounds.

